					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-687092#post-1846487</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-687092/a-poem-for-nobody#post-1846487</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 06 Sep 2013 01:09:16 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Captain Cain</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1522769</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It is a great last couple of lines; since Nobody has <em>always</em> been Nobody, than we could all have been Nobody, and nobody would know. It might be Nobody's mission that nobody knows about, to find some nobody who hasn't been Nobody yet, and convince them to take the job. That's cool. Finally Nobody makes slightly more than no<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">body</span> sense.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
