				<wikidot:authorName>Dr Cuddles</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1536640</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It's nice to see some poetry, but it didn't really work for me. I only enjoy poetry when it has a perfect structure and very good rhymes. I don't like when only half the verses rhyme and some of the rhymes felt a bit weak here. Neutral vote for now.</p> 
				 	]]>
